---

### **Hash Table**
insertCourse(course)
compute hash from courseNumber
find appropriate bucket
place course in bucket

**Search Function**
findCourse(courseNumber)
compute hash from courseNumber
look in bucket for match
return course or not found

---

### **Binary Search Tree (BST)**
insert(node, course)
if node is null
create new node with course
else if courseNumber < node.courseNumber
insert left
else
insert right


**Search Function**
find(node, courseNumber)
if node is null
return not found
else if courseNumber == node.courseNumber
return course
else if courseNumber < node.courseNumber
search left
else
search right


